{include "./TypeReport.tpl" desc="<b>Cancellations</b> is the number of subscriptions where the user turned off auto-renew or cancelled, counted on the day they took that action. <b>Uncancellations</b> is the number where the user turned auto-renew back on before access ended, counted on the day they restored it. The <b>Ended</b> report counts subscriptions by the day access actually ended; this report counts cancel and restore decisions when they happen, which is often earlier in the billing period."}
